  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2223\">\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2223\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2181\">Negative (Not Detected):</strong> No mutations found in JAK2 exons 12&ndash;15.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2464\">\n<p data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2320\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2250\">Positive (Detected):</strong> Mutation consistent with <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2307\">myeloproliferative neoplasm</strong>, especially:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2464\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2383\">\n<p data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2383\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2339\">JAK2 V617F</strong> &ndash; Found in ~95% of PV, ~50&ndash;60% of ET/PMF.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2464\">\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2464\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2409\">Exon 12 Mutations</strong> &ndash; Seen in ~3&ndash;5% of PV patients who are V617F negative.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
